0 61 563 [
[(If you're writing to and reading from a delay line, you have to get the write)]
[(sorted before the read or else you may not get less than a block's delay. This)]
[(patch compares a "wrong" flanger with a "right" one:)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
