/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 61 442 [
[(To hear the difference scroll the delay time between 0 and 100 samples. The)]
[(patch at right doesn't let you get below 64 samples, but the patch at left can)]
[(go all the way down to one sample.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
